Output Files
bbRepack_#.out                      = output for backbone repack optimization separated by sequence #
energyFile.csv                      = 
errors.out                          = error output file
rerun.config                        = configuration file to repeat this run
seqSearch_#.pdb                     = pdb of sequence # after the sequence search
sequence_search_trajectory_#.pdb    = structures of accepted sequences traversed by Monte Carlo sequence search #
sequenceSearchEnergyLandscape_#.out = contains the sequences traversed for sequence #
summary.out                         = summarized run detail of program run times (contains SCMF initial energies and Monte Carlo Sequence Searches)
test_#.pdb                          = final output pdb of sequence # (test can be replaced with in the configfile with variable: runNumber)
x#_cross#_ax#_z#_vdW#.pdb           = initial starting geometry pdb file; # correspond to values for each geometric term and vdW 


energyFile.csv columns:
Sequence                       = output sequence
RotamerValues                  = rotamer level for each residue (0-total number SASARepackLevels)
Interface                      = Mask of the interfacial positions with 1 indicating interface, 0 for non-interface
InterfaceSequence              = Mask of amino acids in sequence that are interfacial residues, - for non-interface
Seed                           = seed used for this run (defaults to random seed)
Density                        = density of the starting point from kernel density estimation of OPM pdbs (Figure 1; designFiles/2021_10_11_geometryDensityFile.txt)
Baseline                       = summation of estimated monomer energy for the sequence (computed by averaging 10000s of random sequences and averaging energetic contribution for each AA residue; baseline values found in designFiles directory)
Dimer                          = dimer energy of the sequence
Dimerw/Baseline                = dimer energy minus baseline
HBONDDimer                     = hydrogen bond energy of the dimer
HBONDMonomer                   = hydrogen bond energy of the monomer
HBOND_Optimize                 = hydrogen bond energy of the optimized structure
HBOND_PreOptimize              = hydrogen bond energy of the unoptimized structure
IMM1REFDimer                   = IMM1 reference dimer energy
IMM1REFMonomer                 = IMM1 reference monomer energy
IMM1REF_Optimize               = IMM1 reference energy of the optimized structure
IMM1REF_PreOptimize            = IMM1 reference energy of the unoptimized structure
IMM1Dimer                      = IMM1 dimer energy
IMM1Monomer                    = IMM1 monomer energy
IMM1_Optimize                  = IMM1 energy of the optimized structure
IMM1_PreOptimize               = IMM1 energy of the unoptimized structure
Monomer                        = monomer energy
MonomerSasa                    = monomer solvent accessible surface area
OptimizeSasa                   = optimized solvent accessible surface area
PreBBOptimizeSasa              = solvent accessible surface area of unoptimized structure
SequenceEntropy                = estimated entropy of the interface sequence occuring in nature using given AAs converted to a Shannon entropy term (calculations and equations on lines 668-687, 3485-3551 in seqDesign.cpp)
SequenceProbability            = estimated probability of the interface sequence occuring in nature using given AAs 
Total                          = total energy of the sequence (dimer + monomer)
TotalPreOptimize               = total energy of the sequence (dimer + monomer) for the unoptimized structure
Totalw/Entropy                 = total energy of the sequence (dimer + monomer) + sequence entropy
VDWDimer                       = van der Waals energy of the dimer
VDWMonomer                     = van der Waals energy of the monomer
VDW_Optimize                   = van der Waals energy of the optimized structure
VDW_PreOptimize                = van der Waals energy of the unoptimized structure
acceptCycleNumber              = number of accepted cycles
acceptTemp                     = temperature of accepted states
end_axialRotation              = final structure axial rotation
end_axialRotationPrime         = final structure axial rotation (prime)
end_crossingAngle              = final structure crossing angle
end_xShift                     = final structure x shift
end_zShift                     = final structure z shift
end_zShiftPrime                = final structure z shift (prime)
firstRepackEnergy              = energy of the first repacking
preOptimizeEnergy              = energy of the unoptimized structure
preOptimize_axialRotation      = axial rotation of the unoptimized structure
preOptimize_axialRotationPrime = axial rotation (prime) of the unoptimized structure
preOptimize_crossingAngle      = crossing angle of the unoptimized structure
preOptimize_xShift             = x shift of the unoptimized structure
preOptimize_zShift             = z shift of the unoptimized structure
preOptimize_zShiftPrime        = z shift (prime) of the unoptimized structure
preRepackTotal                 = total energy of the unoptimized structure (dimer + monomer)
replicateNumber                = replicate number of the run (sequence #)
start_axialRotation            = axial rotation of the starting structure
start_axialRotationPrime       = axial rotation (prime) of the starting structure
start_crossingAngle            = crossing angle of the starting structure
start_xShift                   = x shift of the starting structure
start_zShift                   = z shift of the starting structure
start_zShiftPrime              = z shift (prime) of the starting structure